From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:15:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] KITKAT: P10 followup: fix SystemUI-core javac symbol
 errors

- KitKatBrightnessTile / KitKatSettingsTile / KitKatUserTile: the
  SystemUI R class lives in com.android.systemui.res (upstream moved
  it out of com.android.systemui) - fix the imports.
- KitKatRecentsActivity: ThumbnailData.thumbnail is a Kotlin val with
  a getter (thumbnail.getThumbnail()) - no field access from Java.
- KitKatRecentsImpl: ActivityManager.TaskInfo does not exist - TaskInfo
  is a top-level android.app class and only RecentTaskInfo nests in
  ActivityManager. Iterate getTaskInfoList() into a RecentTaskInfo[]
  instead.

Change-Id: Id1d1a180fb9eed6d99b802232d7efbccc8ba23d0
